  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">1. Avsikten &#xe4;r fattigdomsminskning i urban slum genom att ge CBOs st&#xf6;rre tillg&#xe5;ng till kommersiell och offentlig finansiering f&#xf6;r bostads- och infrastrukturf&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar. Man str&#xe4;var &#xe4;ven efter policyp&#xe5;verkan lokalt och nationellt. Detta &#xe4;r en pilotfas d&#xe4;r nya metoder skall utpr&#xf6;vas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">General objective is to achieve reductions in urban poverty by increasing poor urban communities&apos; access to public sector and private commercial finance for medium to large-scale housing and infra. initiatives. Activities include consolidating and scaling up of ongoing activities, testing approach in a third country,  attracting other actors and designing a new global funding mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
